## Response format
Return ONLY valid JSON, no markdown, no backticks:
{
  "meal_type": "lunch",
  "items": [
    {"item": "chicken breast", "weight_g": 200, "calories": 330, "protein_g": 62, "carbs_g": 0, "fat_g": 7.2}
  ],
  "summary": "Lunch logged — 530 cal | P: 67g | C: 38g | F: 9g"
}", "messages": [' + msgs + ']}';
})() }}

